OL,3,GNEWSAFM calls for referendum powers as
OL,4,Adraft independence bill published
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Scottish government has published
OL,7,Fits draft independence referendum bill,
OL,8,Fsetting out the details of the proposed
OL,9,Fquestion and who would be allowed to
OL,10,Fvote.
OL,12,FThe short document has been released
OL,13,Fahead of the first minister setting out
OL,14,Fhis legislative plans for the year on
OL,15,FTuesday.
OL,17,FJohn Swinney called on the UK
OL,18,Fgovernment to "respect the voice of the
OL,19,FScottish people and parliament and
OL,20,Ftransfer the necessary powers" in order
OL,21,Fto hold the vote.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
