OL,3,GNEWSAFM calls for referendum powers as
OL,4,Adraft independence bill published
OL,5,
OL,6,FSince 2014 successive UK governments
OL,7,Fhave opposed any further referendums
OL,8,Fand Downing Street recently said a
OL,9,Ffresh poll was "off limits". The
OL,10,FScotland Office has been approached for
OL,11,Fcomment.
